# Sage — Cursor rules

Read ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/BACKEND_SPEC.md, and TODO.md before generating code.
Build phases in TODO.md order. Do not skip ahead to marketplace before Auth + Catalog + Visual Check work.

## Billing isolation (non-negotiable)
1. Digital goods (Sage+ subscription, Visual Check credit packs) = RevenueCat / StoreKit / Play Billing ONLY.
2. Physical goods (marketplace specimen purchases) = Stripe Connect ONLY (destination charge, manual capture).
3. Never charge for digital goods through Stripe inside the mobile app.
4. Feature gates read DB truth written by webhooks (`profiles.plan`, `credit_ledger`) — never client purchase state alone.

## Security
- Anthropic, Stripe secret, RevenueCat webhook auth: Edge Function env only. Never ship in the app.
- RLS on every table; storage buckets private with signed URLs.
- Strip EXIF/GPS client-side before any photo upload (`lib/images.ts`).
- Price math in integer cents, server-side only. Client never sends amounts for orders.
- Soft-delete accounts + 30-day purge (App Store requirement).

## Deno Edge Functions
- Use Deno-style imports (`https://esm.sh/...` or `npm:`). Do not use Node `require`.
- Shared CORS helpers live in `supabase/functions/_shared/cors.ts`.
- Webhooks (`revenuecat-webhook`, `stripe-webhook`) deploy with `--no-verify-jwt` and verify their own signatures.

## Design language
Warm bone `#EBE7DD`, ink `#22281F`, sage green `#46594A` (hover `#2E3B31`), muted `#6C7265`, faint `#98938A`.
Display: Instrument Serif. UI: Instrument Sans. Tokens live in `constants/theme.ts`.
Calm archival / field-journal feel — specimen cabinet, not fintech dashboard.

## Visual Check framing
Every result screen must show the second-opinion disclaimer from `constants/copy.ts`.
Never present Visual Check as certified authentication.
